OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA fresh start with the odd mist
OL,6,Fpatch in rural areas, but these will
OL,7,Fquickly clear. Otherwise a dry and
OL,8,Fsunny day across the region, although
OL,9,Fthe sunshine may become rather hazy at
OL,10,Ftimes. Feeling very warm with light
OL,11,Fwinds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA dry and fine evening with
OL,14,Fplenty of late sunshine. Overnight
OL,15,Fwill remain dry with clear spells, but
OL,16,Ffeeling a little warmer than recent
OL,17,Fnights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
