OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FAnother fine and dry day with
OL,6,Fplenty of sunshine across South West
OL,7,FEngland. Feeling hot in the sunshine
OL,8,Fand light winds.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA
OL,11,Flittle more cloud in the sky on
OL,12,FMonday, before the sunny weather
OL,13,Freturns on Tuesday and Wednesday.
OL,14,FTemperatures briefly dip on Monday
OL,15,Fbefore becoming hot once again by
OL,16,FWednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
